"The rules are tried in order, top to bottom. For each product of the sale, the first rule that fits\n"
"                        decides its months and its deposit account. The sale offers only the months that every product allows;\n"
"                        its money goes to the account of the rule placed highest, unless the point of sale splits the charge."
